    "message": "Stage 9 B1-prime: v3.2 proposal, non-signing v3.2 dry-run workflow, records (#16)\n\nAdds the unapplied v3.2 candidate (runner disk fix), its local checks,\nthe B1/B2 and Docker cleanup records, and one manual-dispatch workflow\nwith contents: read only and no OIDC token. No protected file changes.\nRecords U108-U111. All six Stage 9 EXITs remain NOT RUN.\n\nCo-authored-by: mack-dot <235131950+mack-dot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
